    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 27 North Street to the Dublin 15 property market.\r\n\r\nThis superb one-bedroom, ground-floor own-door apartment comes to the market in excellent condition, offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation in the heart of Ongar Village. Extending to approximately 48.8 sq.m (525 sq.ft), the property has been thoughtfully laid out to maximise space and natural light throughout and has been recently upgraded with a newly fitted kitchen and new flooring throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming living room, a modern fitted kitchen, a spacious double bedroom, a bathroom, and a hallway with additional storage. The property also benefits from its own private entrance with canopies to the front, providing shelter and adding to the overall curb appeal as well as and a patio area with access to electricity and water points. The own-door access offers an extra level of privacy and convenience rarely found in apartment living.\r\n\r\nNorth Street enjoys an enviable location within walking distance of Ongar Village, where a wide range of amenities are available, including supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, schools, gyms, and medical centres. The area is well serviced by public transport, with several Dublin Bus routes providing easy access to the city centre. The M3, M50, and N3 road networks are all close by, making commuting quick and convenient.\r\n\r\nThe property is also within easy reach of Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, one of Dublin’s premier retail destinations, as well as numerous parks and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nThis apartment represents an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a stylish, turnkey home in a highly sought-after and convenient location.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and encourage viewers to seek their own opinion on any concerns.***"
      },
